WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.467
-Guys, today is Friday
and that's usually

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:03.734
when I catch up on some personal
stuff, you know.

00:00:03.734 --> 00:00:05.968
I check my inbox,
I return some emails,

00:00:05.968 --> 00:00:07.868
and, of course,
I send out thank you notes.

00:00:07.868 --> 00:00:09.501
[ Cheering and applause ]
And I was running --

00:00:09.501 --> 00:00:11.634
running a bit behind today,

00:00:11.634 --> 00:00:13.067
so, I thought,
if you guys wouldn't mind,

00:00:13.067 --> 00:00:14.701
I'd like to write out my weekly
thank you notes right now.

00:00:14.701 --> 00:00:15.567
Is that okay with you?

00:00:15.567 --> 00:00:17.601
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:17.601 --> 00:00:18.767
Appreciate it.
James, can I get

00:00:18.767 --> 00:00:20.367
some thank you note writing
music, please?

00:00:20.367 --> 00:00:21.901
-[ Playing tender tune ]
-Oh, there you go.

00:00:21.901 --> 00:00:24.234
[ Laughter ]

00:00:24.234 --> 00:00:25.400
Wow.
-Ooh!

00:00:27.234 --> 00:00:29.434
-[Indistinct]
-Hm.

00:00:29.434 --> 00:00:30.234
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:32.300
-Thank you, Ron DeSantis'

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.167
ongoing feud with Disney World,

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:36.334
for making even parents say,

00:00:36.334 --> 00:00:37.834
"Let it go!"

00:00:37.834 --> 00:00:40.767
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.200
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.334
Thank you, weed gummies,

00:00:47.334 --> 00:00:49.534
[ Laughter ]
for coming in two varieties --

00:00:49.534 --> 00:00:52.334
barely feel it
or enter the 11th dimension.

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:56.000
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.467
-[ Warbling ]

00:00:58.467 --> 00:01:00.300
[ Warbling ] Jimmy.
-Oh, wow.

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:02.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.467 --> 00:01:03.534
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.534 --> 00:01:05.968
Thank you,
"Super Mario Bros," movie,

00:01:05.968 --> 00:01:08.934
for being expected to make
a billion dollars.

00:01:08.934 --> 00:01:10.701
Or, in Mario terms...

00:01:10.701 --> 00:01:12.200
[ Chiming ]

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:15.133
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.200
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:23.434
Thank you, Earth Day,
for sounding like someone

00:01:23.434 --> 00:01:26.200
suppressing a burp
while saying the word birthday.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:26.968
[ Laughter and applause ]
Earth Day.

00:01:30.334 --> 00:01:31.467
Happy Earth Day.

00:01:31.467 --> 00:01:32.234
-Earth Day.

00:01:32.234 --> 00:01:34.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.267 --> 00:01:35.434
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.434 --> 00:01:38.334
-Thank you, SpaceX Starship...
-Aw.

00:01:38.334 --> 00:01:40.033
-...for being a failed
rocket launch,

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:42.501
but a super successful
fireworks launch.

00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:44.467
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:01:44.467 --> 00:01:45.701
-Aah! Ooh!

00:01:45.701 --> 00:01:49.067
-Ooh, ah ooh, ah.
That's my favorite. Ooh, ah.

00:01:49.067 --> 00:01:50.601
-[ Scat singing Fucik's
"Entrance of the Gladiators" ]
-No, that one's my favorite.

00:01:50.601 --> 00:01:52.434
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.501 --> 00:01:53.601
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.601 --> 00:01:55.467
Thank you, artists,

00:01:55.467 --> 00:01:58.300
for creating the world's
most beautiful music, paintings,

00:01:58.300 --> 00:01:59.734
and Subway sandwiches.

00:01:59.734 --> 00:02:02.734
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:06.267 --> 00:02:07.167
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.167 --> 00:02:09.167
Thank you, alarm clocks,

00:02:09.167 --> 00:02:11.000
for wearing
noise canceling headphones.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:11.934
Oh, there you have it,
everybody,

00:02:11.934 --> 00:02:12.801
those are our "Thank You Notes."

